│\u001b[18;100H│\u001b[19;1H│\u001b[19;100H│\u001b[20;1H│\u001b[20;100H│\u001b[21;1H│\u001b[21;100H│\u001b[22;1H│\u001b[22;100H│\u001b[23;1H│\u001b[23;100H│\u001b[24;1H│\u001b[24;100H│\u001b[25;1H│\u001b[25;100H│\u001b[26;1H│\u001b[26;100H│\u001b[27;1H│\u001b[27;100H│\u001b[28;1H│\u001b[28;100H│\u001b[29;1H│\u001b[29;100H│\u001b[4;1H╞══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╡\u001b[1;1H╒\u001b[1;100H╕\u001b[30;1H╘\u001b[30;100H╛\u001b[2;2H\u001b[0;93;41m                                                                                                  \u001b[2;2HMove\u001b[2;88HScore\u001b[3;2H\u001b[0;93;47m                                                                                                  \u001b[3;2H\u001b[0;97;45mPlayer Condition:\u001b[19;20H\u001b[0;93;40mWorking 14 hours a day in the core of some dusty, smelly mine\u001b[20;29His not your idea of the perfect lifestyle.\u001b[21;16HBarre-An is a dust ball in space, its only salvation being that it is\u001b[22;16Hrich in precious barre-an metal.  Or used to be.  Nowadays the mines\u001b[23;19Hdon't seem so generous, which is why you're looking for a more\u001b[24;41Hprofitable venture.\u001b[25;21HA break, that's all you ask for, maybe today you figure...\u001b[28;2H\u001b[0;94;40mTavern\u001b[29;2H\u001b[0;96;40mThis is a tavern on the outskirts of the East Barre-An mining colony.  The bar here is the local w\u001b[29;99H \u001b[5;29r\u001b[29;1H\u001bD\u001b[r\u001b[29;1H\u001b[0;37;44m│\u001b[0;96;40m                                                                                                  \u001b[0;37;44m│\u001b[29;2H\u001b[0;96;40mwaterhole for the miners.  There are three tables here, one in the eastern corner of the room, ano\u001b[29;97H   \u001b[5;29r\u001b[29;1H\u001bD\u001b[r\u001b[29;1H\u001b[0;37;44m│\u001b[0;96;40m                                                                                                  \u001b[0;37;44m│\u001b[29;2H\u001b[0;96;40manother in the western corner and the last one in the middle of them both.  Behind the bar, on the\u001b[5;29r\u001b[29;1H\u001bD\u001b[r\u001b[29;1H\u001b[0;37;44m│\u001b[0;96;40m                                                                                                  \u001b[0;37;44m│\u001b[29;2H\u001b[0;96;40mwall, is a small menu.  Near the east table is a stairway leading up.  There's a pair of swinging \u001b[5;29r\u001b[29;1H\u001bD\u001b[r\u001b[29;1H\u001b[0;37;44m│\u001b[0;96;40m                                                                                                  \u001b[0;37;44m│\u001b[29;2H\u001b[0;96;40mdoors to the south.  The bartender is working behind the ba"]
